# .hypatia-ignore — scoped, documented exemptions for the Hypatia scanner.
# Format: <rule_module>/<rule_type>:<path-fragment> (substring match), or
# <rule_module>/*:<path-fragment>, or a bare <path-fragment>.
# Every entry MUST carry a stated reason. Prefer fix-the-code or an inline
# directive over an entry here; this file is for whole-file/directory
# exemptions. Built-in defaults live in hypatia's scanner_suppression —
# do not duplicate them.

# docs-template/ is template payload describing downstream generated repos;
# its example paths (src/middleware/request_id.rs, src/main.rs, ...) do not
# resolve against this repo's tree, so SD022 (stale src/ reference) fires
# falsely. Same exemption as hermeneia and vocarium carry.
structural_drift/SD022:docs-template/
